codex
The first target claim closes fresh, but K emits `WarnTrivialClaim`: its fully concrete `checkRange` term simplifies to `true` before reachability rewriting. That does not decide legitimacy by itself; the upcoming static audit and false mutation must establish whether this is truthful computation or a vacuous/answer-encoding shortcut.
