+| SY16–SY17 | `semantic.k:31-32` | `VNil`, `VCons` | Tuple value representation. |
+| F1–F3 | `semantic.k:34-36` | `evalExpr`, `nthValue`, `evalNthExpr` `[function]` | Partial evaluators; every actual call is covered. |
